OL,3,GNEWSAIrish police social media accounts
OL,4,Abreached by hackers
OL,5,
OL,6,FA number of social media accounts used
OL,7,Fby An Garda Siochana (Irish police)
OL,8,Fhave been hacked and used to promote
OL,9,Fcryptocurrency.
OL,11,FThe @GardaTraffic and @GardaInfo X
OL,12,Faccounts removed Garda branding and
OL,13,Fbegan publishing posts promoting a
OL,14,Fcryptocurrency on Wednesday night,
OL,15,Faccording to Irish broadcaster RTE.
OL,17,FSome posts on the accounts were flagged
OL,18,Fwith warnings indicating they are
OL,19,Flinked to another suspended profile,
OL,20,Fwhile the location of the accounts was
OL,21,Fchanged to Amsterdam.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,416,410,260,120,0,100
