OL,3,GNEWSAIrish police social media accounts
OL,4,Abreached by hackers
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn Garda Siochana said the
OL,7,F"unauthorised access" occurred only on
OL,8,Fthe X platform, adding that Garda
OL,9,Fsystems were not affected and there was
OL,10,F"no loss or impact on any Garda data".
